# Food Ghor — 6-Document Context Architecture
### *Optimized for Google AI Studio (Gemini) as primary coding agent*

Since **Google AI Studio** behaves differently from file-system agents like Claude Code or Cursor (it works via **System Instructions + attached context files**, not `read_file()` tool calls), this architecture ships with **three agent-config layers**:

| Layer | File | Purpose |
|-------|------|---------|
| Primary | `AI_STUDIO_SYSTEM_PROMPT.md` | Paste into Google AI Studio's **System Instructions** field |
| Portable | `CLAUDE.md` | For when you swap agents later (Claude Code, Cursor) |
| Portable | `.cursorrules` | For Cursor sessions |

Plus the **6 authoritative docs** under `/docs/`. Together they give Gemini zero ambiguity.

