# 01 — Product Requirements Document (PRD)
**Product:** Food Ghor (ফুড ঘর) — Premium Jaggery Landing Page
**Business Owner:** Independent Bangladeshi SME (single operator)
**Prepared for:** Gemini (Google AI Studio) as coding agent
**Version:** 1.0.0 · **Status:** LOCKED

---

## 1. Core Problem
Jaggery (গুড়) in Bangladesh is sold as a **commodity**, not a **brand**. Small sellers fight on price in crowded marketplaces (Daraz, Facebook Pages) with weak storytelling, inconsistent visuals, and zero trust signals. Buyers who *want* to pay a premium for authentic, chemical-free, region-sourced jaggery (পাটালি গুড়, নলেন গুড়, খেজুর গুড়) have no premium Bengali-first destination.

**Food Ghor exists to convert commodity into premium** by:
1. Teaching purity (কেমিক্যাল-মুক্ত, দেশি, মৌসুমি) through premium Bengali content
2. Building trust (sourcing story + testimonials + clear contact)
3. Capturing **qualified leads** (call / WhatsApp / inquiry form) without owning a full e-commerce stack

## 2. Target Persona

### Primary — "রহিমা বেগম" · Premium Retail Buyer
- **Age:** 28–45
- **Location:** Urban Bangladesh (Dhaka, Chattogram, Sylhet)
- **Income:** Mid-to-high; health-conscious; willing to pay 20–35% premium
- **Device:** Android, ~4G, portrait mobile
- **Language:** Bengali only; reads on WhatsApp/Facebook daily
- **Fear:** Adulterated jaggery (চিনি মেশানো, কেমিক্যাল)
- **Trigger:** Family health, festivals (পৌষ, শীতকালীন গুড়), gifting

### Secondary — "সুজন ভাই" · B2B Wholesale Buyer
- **Role:** Owner of a small মিষ্টির দোকান / bakery / café
- **Need:** Consistent bulk supply, invoice, predictable pricing
- **Behavior:** Cares about reliability over storytelling; needs to signal wholesale in inquiry form

## 3. MVP User Stories

| ID | As a… | I want… | So that… | Priority |
|----|-------|---------|----------|----------|
| US-01 | Visitor | A hero that communicates "premium Bengali jaggery" in <5s | I trust the brand immediately | P0 |
| US-02 | Visitor | To browse all products in a Bengali grid (name, weight, price) | I can pick what I want | P0 |
| US-03 | Visitor | A product detail page with long-form Bengali description + sourcing | I understand the value | P0 |
| US-04 | Visitor | To submit an inquiry form (name, phone, product, qty, message) | Owner contacts me | P0 |
| US-05 | Visitor | A "WhatsApp-এ অর্ডার করুন" CTA with a prefilled Bengali message | One-tap ordering | P0 |
| US-06 | Visitor | A "ফোনে অর্ডার" tel: link | I can call directly | P0 |
| US-07 | Visitor | To read the sourcing story + benefits | I'm convinced of purity | P1 |
| US-08 | Visitor | To see testimonials with real names + locations | I trust the brand | P1 |
| US-09 | Visitor | A clear Bengali thank-you after inquiry | I know it worked | P0 |
| US-10 | B2B buyer | To flag my inquiry as "পাইকারি" | Owner responds with bulk pricing | P1 |
| US-11 | Owner (admin) | To log in and manage products/categories/testimonials/inquiries | I run the site myself | P0 |
| US-12 | Owner (admin) | To mark inquiry status (new → contacted → converted → closed) | I track my pipeline | P1 |

## 4. Success Metrics (first 90 days post-launch)

| Metric | Target | How measured |
|--------|--------|--------------|
| Inquiry form conversion | ≥ 3.0% of unique visitors | Server log count |
| WhatsApp CTA click-through | ≥ 8% | Frontend event |
| Mobile LCP (4G) | < 2.5s | Lighthouse CI |
| Lighthouse Mobile Perf | ≥ 90 | Lighthouse CI |
| Lighthouse A11y | ≥ 95 | Lighthouse CI |
| Bounce rate | < 55% | Privacy-first analytics (Plausible, optional) |
| API p95 (inquiry POST) | ≤ 300ms | Server logs |
| P0 security incidents | 0 | Manual audit |

## 5. Out of Scope — STRICT Non-Goals (v1)

Any PR that introduces the following **must be rejected**:

- ❌ Customer registration / accounts
- ❌ Payment gateway (bKash, SSLCommerz, Nagad, Stripe)
- ❌ Shopping cart, checkout, order tracking
- ❌ English or Arabic UI (Bengali only)
- ❌ Mobile app (iOS / Android native)
- ❌ Blog engine / CMS (use `frontend/src/content/bn.ts` for static copy)
- ❌ Email marketing automation
- ❌ Real-time inventory sync / stock management UI
- ❌ Facebook Pixel / Google Analytics by default (privacy-first; opt-in only)
- ❌ Server-side rendering (Vite SPA only)
- ❌ Microservices / GraphQL / WebSockets
- ❌ Push notifications
- ❌ Admin mobile app (admin UI = web only, desktop-first)

## 6. Non-Functional Requirements
- **Language:** 100% Bengali (bn-BD) UI text. English only inside code identifiers and brand name "Food Ghor".
- **Mobile-first:** Designed from 375px; graceful up to 1440px+.
- **Accessibility:** WCAG 2.1 AA. `<html lang="bn">`. All interactive elements keyboard-reachable.
- **Performance:** Initial JS ≤ 200KB gzipped. Hero image ≤ 180KB. CLS ≤ 0.05.
- **SEO:** Bengali `<title>`, `<meta>`, Open Graph, JSON-LD `Product` + `LocalBusiness`.
- **Security:** See `04_TRD.md §5` — non-negotiable.
- **Hosting tolerance:** Shared PHP hosting (PHP-FPM 8.3 + MySQL 8), best-effort uptime.

## 7. Assumptions
- Single-tenant deployment; one business.
- Owner supplies product photos (WebP preferred), logo, and Bengali long-form copy.
- WhatsApp Business number is live.
- SSL certificate provisioned by host.
- Owner is comfortable using a simple admin panel (no CMS training needed beyond CRUD forms).
