## 5. Core Component States

### 5.1 `Button`
**Variants:** `primary`, `secondary`, `ghost`, `whatsapp` (green #25D366, white text)
**Sizes:** `sm` (h-9, px-3, text-sm) · `md` (h-11, px-4, text-base) · `lg` (h-13, px-6, text-lg)

| State | Treatment |
|-------|-----------|
| default | `--radius-md`, `shadow-sm` |
| hover | darken 1 step + `translate-y-[-1px]`, `shadow-md` |
| active | `translate-y-0`, `shadow-sm` |
| focus-visible | 2px `--color-focus-ring`, offset 2px |
| disabled | opacity 0.5, cursor not-allowed, no hover |
| loading | spinner replaces icon, label "পাঠানো হচ্ছে…", disabled |

### 5.2 `ProductCard`
- Image 4:3, `object-cover`, `--radius-md`, `loading="lazy"`, `srcset` at 480/800/1200
- Content padding: `p-4`
- Name: `text-xl font-semibold`
- Weight: `text-sm text-muted` (Bengali numerals: ৫০০ গ্রাম)
- Price: `text-lg font-bold text-brand-700` (৳ ৪৮০)
- Short desc: `text-sm`, 2-line clamp (`line-clamp-2`)
- Hover: `shadow-md`, image `scale-105` over 300ms, `transition-transform`
- Focusable wrapper with `aria-label` in Bengali

### 5.3 `Input` / `Textarea` / `Select`
- Height: `h-11` (input/select), `min-h-[8rem]` (textarea)
- Border: `border --color-border`, `bg --color-surface`
- Focus: `border-brand-700` + `ring-2 ring-accent-500/40`
- Error: `border-error`, `text-error` helper below
- Disabled: `opacity-60`, `cursor-not-allowed`
- Label always above (never placeholder-only)

### 5.4 `Toast` (via `sonner`)
- Position: top-right desktop, top-center mobile
- Auto-dismiss 5s, `role="status"`
- Variants: success (green), error (red), warning (amber), info (neutral)

### 5.5 `Skeleton`
- `bg-surface-alt` + shimmer keyframe (2s infinite)
- Used in every async view

### 5.6 `EmptyState` / `ErrorState`
- Centered, icon (lucide 40px), heading, subtext, optional action button
- Uses `--color-text-muted` for supporting text

### 5.7 `Badge`
- Small pill, `text-xs`, `px-2 py-1`, `rounded-full`
- Variants: `trust` (gold outline), `status` (success/warning/error)

---

## 6. Icons
- **Library:** `lucide-react` (outline, 1.5px stroke)
- **Sizes:** 16 / 20 / 24
- **Color:** inherits `currentColor`
- **Never** use emoji as primary iconography

---

## 7. Imagery
- **Products:** 1200×900 (4:3), WebP + JPG fallback, `loading="lazy"`, `decoding="async"`
- **Hero:** WebP < 180KB, `fetchpriority="high"`
- **Alt text:** Bengali, descriptive (e.g., "দেশি পাটালি গুড়ের কাঠি")
- **Fallback:** gradient `linear-gradient(135deg, #D4A574, #7A4F2C)` + jaggery icon

---

## 8. Motion (Framer Motion)
- Fade + slide-up 12px, 400ms, `ease: [0.22, 1, 0.36, 1]`
- Stagger children 60ms
- `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` → all durations 0ms, no transforms
- **Never** animate `width`, `height`, `top`, `left` — use `transform`/`opacity` only

---

## 9. Responsive Breakpoints
| Breakpoint | Width | Notes |
|------------|-------|-------|
| `sm` | 640px | 2-col product grid |
| `md` | 768px | Inline nav appears, hero 2-col |
| `lg` | 1024px | 3-col product grid |
| `xl` | 1280px | Max container width |

- **Grid:** 1 col < sm, 2 col sm–lg, 3 col ≥ lg
