## 10. Accessibility (WCAG 2.1 AA)
- `<html lang="bn">`
- Focus rings always visible (never `outline: none` without replacement)
- All interactive elements keyboard reachable (Tab, Enter, Space, Esc for modals)
- Icon-only buttons have `aria-label` in Bengali
- Form fields use `aria-describedby` for helper/error IDs
- Skip-to-content link at top of `<body>`
- Contrast verified per §1

